# Commands run by the launchd job com.hackios.demo (see com.hackios.demo.plist).
# The four cameras, one after the other (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.cameras, with cam=5): camera_test cycle asks the kernel's
# /dev/hk-camera for the macro, the wide, the front and the ultra-wide camera in turn (HK_CAMERA_SENSOR),
# 30 frames of each, and says what came of each and how long each change took; twice over. The kernel's "camera:"
# lines say each sensor's packets and errors at the end of its frames.
/hackios/bin/sound_test springboard
/hackios/bin/camera_test cycle 30
/hackios/bin/camera_test cycle 30
